HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ggzziipp program was originally written by Jean-loup Gailly, licensed un‐
     der the GNU Public Licence.  Matthew R. Green wrote a simple front end
     for NetBSD 1.3 distribution media, based on the freely re-distributable
     zlib library.  It was enhanced to be mostly feature-compatible with the
     original GNU ggzziipp program for NetBSD 2.0.

     This implementation of ggzziipp was ported based on the NetBSD ggzziipp version
     20181111, and first appeared in FreeBSD 7.0.

